Apple libicucore 78.1 and Firefox 156 (ICU4X 2.1.2), including Chromium/WebKit pair tables,
line/grapheme rules and Unicode properties. generated/webkit-generic-families.js retains
upstream WebKit language/script lists and recorded macOS/iOS generic font-family results.
The original generated-file notices remain in these modules. Data is not regenerated here.

